  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Solomon Islands Geological Survey Division to monitor volcanic activity at Savo Island</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This&#xa0;Activity will support the Geological Survey Division (GSD) in Solomon Islands Ministry of Mines, Energy, and Rural Electrification to gather and analyse&#xa0;seismic and other monitoring data on&#xa0;Savo Island and to make&#xa0;decisions&#xa0;on&#xa0;precautionary and/or response actions to be undertaken in response to recent and ongoing volcanic activity.</narrative>
  </description>
